Output images for each case
---------------------------
Download the outputs.zip file from the following Hugging Face repository:

https://huggingface.co/datasets/Path2AI/MRI_Ultrasound_Visualizer/blob/main/outputs.zip

After downloading, unzip the archive and extract all files and subfolders contained within the outputs/ directory.

